  "question": {
    "text": "If the coefficients of three consecutive terms in the expansion of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math> are in the ratio <math><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to"
